CaO(s) + H₂O(l) → Ca(OH)₂(s)

**Calculation:**

ΔH = (-281.1 kJ/mol) - (-280.1 kJ/mol + (-285.8 kJ/mol))
ΔH = -281.1 + 280.1 + 285.8
Δ100.8 kJ/mol

